# playpick: mode=raid boss=flasks spec=warlock:destruction style=idle size=10
# difficulty=normal view=390x844,touch save=fresh
#
# The Two Flasks has only been seen in mode=daily so far (25-normal, with an
# affix riding it both times), never as a plain raid pull and never at
# 10-normal. direction.md's #1 ("doing nothing wins") has three cells now
# (Marrowgar, Bonegrinder, Long Cold) but no caster dps and no affix-free look
# at this specific boss, whose own idle/good gap is already on
# docs/upkeep.md's table (+32) from the harness -- this checks whether a
# played session actually shows that shape, not just the harness average.
# First warlock this job has played.
open #b=flasks&s=10&h=1
targets
ui
tap class:warlock:destruction
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot idle-open

play idle 180
bill
says
state
shot idle-end
